My condolences. It never happened to me on the Astral Plane. (I still
belong to the class of players that have always ascended after reaching
the castle. :-) ) That may be because I *expect* Pestilence to make me
ill, if I get too close to him. But I died from illness caused by a rot
worm in the Wyrm Caves (that was slashem, of course). The problem there
was that you can usually kill rot worms in one hit and that dragons take
much of your attention (they are considerably harder than in vanilla).
So I missed the message, of course, as you did. And I did not heed
sufficient attention to the status line. In fact, I think there should
be a few warnings, similar to fainting before starving. After all, in
reality, you normally notice an illness before it kills you. The game is
a little unfair there.

